# Maple Vellum Archive

This snapshot was resharded into a content-addressed chunk store.
Each file was cut into fixed-size chunks, hashed with SHA-256 and stored once;
identical chunks (duplicate files, shared prefixes, repeated headers) are
deduplicated across the entire tree.

